   00489| /// Run 31428625331 passed all 2,629 tests on macOS, then exceeded the job
   00490| /// budget during cleanup. The focused data-integrity gates had already run the
   00491| /// same tests before the full suite, consuming more than 90 seconds twice.
   00492| #[test]
   00493| fn full_suite_does_not_repeat_focused_data_integrity_checks() {
